{"text":"#include <iostream>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main()\n{\n\n    int fizz = 3, buzz = 5;\n\n    for (int i = 1; i < 47; i++)\n    {\n\n        if (i % fizz == 0 && i % buzz == 0)\n        {\n            cout << \"fizz_Buzz\" << endl;\n        }\n\n        else if (i % fizz == 0)\n        {\n            cout << \"Fizz\" << endl;\n        }\n        else if (i % buzz == 0)\n        {\n            cout << \"Buzz\" << endl;\n        }\n        else\n        {\n            cout << i << endl;\n        }\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n","version":1,"path":"exercises/week2_module2/fizz-buzz.cpp","snapshot":true,"doc":9,"seq":59,"ms":79289,"op":"snap"}
